<!--
=====================================================================
 File: ArtworkDetailsView.fxml   (Screen 5 of 7)
 Layer: VIEW (MVC) - Requirement R1
 Controller: com.artgallery.controller.ArtworkDetailsController
=====================================================================

 PURPOSE
 Shows the selected artwork with its details, likes, ratings and
 comments, and lets the user give feedback.

 LAYOUT PANES TO USE (Lecture 6)
 - BorderPane as the root.
     top    : HBox with backButton and the titleLabel
     left   : VBox with the big ImageView (artworkImageView)
     center : VBox containing
                - GridPane with artist / category labels
                - TextArea with the description (not editable)
                - HBox: likeButton + likesCountLabel
                - HBox: ratingSlider + ratingValueLabel + submitRatingButton
                - averageRatingLabel
     right  : VBox containing
                - Label "Comments"
                - ListView commentsListView        (required ListView, R1)
                - TextArea commentArea + charCountLabel
                - addCommentButton
     bottom : messageLabel

 UI CONTROLS NEEDED (give each an fx:id)
 - ImageView   artworkImageView
 - Label       titleLabel, artistLabel, categoryLabel
 - TextArea    descriptionArea      (editable = false, wrapText = true)
 - Button      likeButton           : "Like" / "Unlike"
 - Label       likesCountLabel      : "0 likes"
 - Slider      ratingSlider         : min 1, max 5, majorTickUnit 1,
                                      snapToTicks, showTickLabels
 - Label       ratingValueLabel     : "3 stars"
 - Button      submitRatingButton   : "Rate"
 - Label       averageRatingLabel   : "Average: - / 5"
 - ListView    commentsListView
 - TextArea    commentArea          : promptText "Write a comment..."
 - Label       charCountLabel       : "0 / 200"
 - Button      addCommentButton     : "Add Comment"
 - Button      backButton           : "Back to Gallery"
 - Label       messageLabel

 EXPECTED INTERACTIONS
 - Like button toggles like/unlike and updates the counter.
 - Moving the slider updates ratingValueLabel (binding, R2).
 - Rate button saves the rating and updates the average.
 - Typing a comment updates the character counter (ChangeListener).
 - Add Comment validates the text and adds it to the ListView.
 - Back returns to GalleryView.fxml.

 CONTROLLER
 fx:controller="com.artgallery.controller.ArtworkDetailsController"
